    "params": {
     "text": "**3 \u00b7 Grouped.** *Show as \u25b8 grouped*, *Group by \u25b8 Region*: each region gets a header row with its row count and subtotals. **Click a region to fold it**; right-click for Expand / Collapse All Groups.\n\n`on all` puts the red \u25bc on negative data rows *and* totals; `on totals` greens the positive subtotals and the grand total without touching the rows.",
