    "params": {
     "text": "**4 \u00b7 Nested.** *Group by \u25b8 Region, Product* nests, outermost first. *Groups start \u25b8 outer level open* shows each region's products folded \u2014 click one to see its rows.\n\n*Subtotals \u25b8 both* writes them on the group row and under the group; `subtotal both \"subtotal\"` changes what follows the name. The grand total is at the top, called *All sales*.",
