     "text": "**6 \u00b7 A matrix total.** Average revenue by region \u00d7 product, with *Total row \u25b8 average*. The total is the average of the **rows** behind each column, not of the four cells above it \u2014 a cell built from many sales counts for more than one built from few. The heatmap leaves the total row out.",
